WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:06.495
Splat! Splat! Splat! The Mighty Man actor blasted Roxy with slime.

2
00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:10.884
"Ahh!" Roxy flew out of the way.

3
00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:14.600
"Brain Invader is controlling Mighty Man!" she thought.

4
00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:17.629
"How do I fight back? I don't want to hurt him."

5
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.422
"Don't fight back!" Brain Invader said.

6
00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:27.614
Roxy's eyes felt heavy. "Okay. Maybe I'll take a nap . . ."

7
00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:32.070
Splat! Splat! Slime sprayed at Roxy.

8
00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:36.393
"Rocket Girl!" Dr. Chen said. "What are you doing?"

9
00:00:36.394 --> 00:00:40.152
"Brain Invader is controlling her," Private Benson said.

10
00:00:40.153 --> 00:00:43.483
"Rocket Girl! Ignore the voice!"

11
00:00:43.484 --> 00:00:46.305
"Huh?" Roxy opened her eyes.

12
00:00:46.306 --> 00:00:49.585
"Fight back!" Private Benson shouted.

13
00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:53.255
Roxy looked down. She was now stuck in slime.

14
00:00:53.256 --> 00:00:55.777
"Yuck!" She struggled to get out.

15
00:00:55.778 --> 00:00:59.008
"Stop moving," Brain Invader said.

16
00:00:59.009 --> 00:01:03.648
"Be quiet!" Roxy pulled herself out of the slime.

17
00:01:03.649 --> 00:01:09.170
Zoom! She flew into the Mighty Man actor.

18
00:01:09.171 --> 00:01:11.495
"Oof!" He fell backward.

19
00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:16.321
Roxy dragged him into another cell.

20
00:01:16.322 --> 00:01:19.337
"I didn't want to attack you," the actor said.

21
00:01:19.338 --> 00:01:23.235
"Someone was controlling me. Was that Brain Invader?"

22
00:01:23.236 --> 00:01:26.838
Roxy nodded. "Do you hear his voice right now?"

23
00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:32.639
"No," the actor said. "I'll stay in here. It's nice and quiet."

24
00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:36.601
Roxy stepped out of the cell.

25
00:01:36.602 --> 00:01:40.149
"Dr. Chen! You need to finish the cure right away!"

26
00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.634
Dr. Chen nodded.

27
00:01:41.635 --> 00:01:44.378
Roxy's watch beeped.

28
00:01:44.379 --> 00:01:48.399
"What does Mayor Bloom need now?" she thought.

29
00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.883
She opened the watch and saw her dad.

30
00:01:50.884 --> 00:01:54.582
"Hey, Roxy. You have chores to do."

31
00:01:54.583 --> 00:02:00.091
"Um, okay." Roxy flew home.

32
00:02:00.092 --> 00:02:03.670
"You need to clean your room," her dad said.

33
00:02:03.671 --> 00:02:08.460
Roxy quickly put away her things.

34
00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.835
She made her bed.

35
00:02:09.836 --> 00:02:15.913
Then her dad wanted her to vacuum the entire house.

36
00:02:15.914 --> 00:02:20.589
Roxy used her super breath.

37
00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:24.333
Dust and dirt flew out through the windows.

38
00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:26.418
But her dad had more chores for her.

39
00:02:26.419 --> 00:02:31.728
"You need to clean the carpets, fix the stairs, paint the living room . . ."

40
00:02:31.729 --> 00:02:37.330
"Oh boy," Roxy thought. "Brain Invader is controlling my dad!"

41
00:02:37.331 --> 00:02:40.661
She heard the villain chuckle.

42
00:02:40.662 --> 00:02:44.778
"Yes. Soon you'll be too tired to fight me!"

43
00:02:44.779 --> 00:02:48.549
"I'll never get too tired to fight you!" Roxy said.

44
00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:52.261
"You'll get tired of this," Brain Invader said.

45
00:02:52.262 --> 00:02:55.856
Boom! Roxy heard an explosion in her head.

46
00:02:55.857 --> 00:02:58.147
"Ahh!" She held her head.

47
00:02:58.148 --> 00:03:01.141
Boom! Boom!

48
00:03:01.142 --> 00:03:05.567
"I can't listen to this!" Roxy flew fast.

49
00:03:05.568 --> 00:03:10.846
She went up, higher and higher.

50
00:03:10.847 --> 00:03:13.640
Soon she was in outer space.

51
00:03:13.641 --> 00:03:16.517
She heard . . . silence.

52
00:03:16.518 --> 00:03:27.985
"Whew!" Roxy said. "Brain Invader probably can't reach me up here."

53
00:03:27.986 --> 00:03:31.882
She sat on a satellite and sighed.

54
00:03:31.883 --> 00:03:33.993
"Regular kids are lucky.

55
00:03:33.994 --> 00:03:39.264
They don't have to go to space to relax!"

